# Cloudflare redirects for bonganagava.com
#
# Ported from .htaccess (Apache/LiteSpeed). Both files must stay in sync.
#
# Two rules are handled in the Cloudflare dashboard instead, not here:
#   - http:// -> https://  (enable "Always Use HTTPS" in SSL/TLS settings)
#   - the extensionless /about -> /about.html rewrite, which the
#     `html_handling: "auto-trailing-slash"` asset option does natively
#
# Cloudflare parses this file and does not serve it as a page.

# www -> apex, matching the canonical tags in every page's <head>.
https://www.bonganagava.com/* https://bonganagava.com/:splat 301